WEBVTT

00:07.320 --> 00:10.290
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

00:10.920 --> 00:13.830
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

00:14.500 --> 00:17.400
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

00:17.870 --> 00:20.860
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

00:21.670 --> 00:24.640
Mekurumeku koshitsuki MUCHO

00:25.270 --> 00:28.260
Kodomo nya kiwadoi AMIGO

00:28.880 --> 00:31.810
Kisu shitara suikomaresou

00:32.510 --> 00:34.950
Kowai momo mitasa TONIGHT

00:36.180 --> 00:37.990
Ojikeduitara dame

00:37.990 --> 00:39.750
Oshite osarete GOING

00:39.750 --> 00:41.620
Dokkiri kibun ga iine

00:41.620 --> 00:43.150
Chakkari asa made DANCING

00:43.790 --> 00:45.060
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.060 --> 00:48.620
TROPICANA

00:50.560 --> 00:53.560
Yashi no kokage de tsukamaete

00:54.270 --> 00:57.240
Jirashite tokoton tokoton

00:57.870 --> 01:00.770
Gomen ne anata wa mou toriko

01:01.410 --> 01:04.340
Nigerarenai Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:05.080 --> 01:07.950
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

01:08.520 --> 01:11.640
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

01:12.320 --> 01:15.220
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

01:15.860 --> 01:18.120
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:24.450 --> 01:27.450
I'll come pick you up... wherever you are...

01:27.760 --> 01:28.990
However many years it may take...

01:29.930 --> 01:32.450
So, wait for me...

01:33.230 --> 01:36.490
Okay. I'll do my best...

01:37.100 --> 01:41.160
I won't give up,
so make sure to come pick me up.

01:44.910 --> 01:46.900
That dream again...

01:47.940 --> 01:50.910
POKUTE LEGEND

01:51.250 --> 01:53.740
I had such a nostalgic dream...

01:54.950 --> 01:57.920
Oh? A dream about the past?

01:58.020 --> 01:59.920
Yup, from when I first left home.

02:00.390 --> 02:03.190
Oh, but this worries me...

02:03.630 --> 02:06.820
So, who is this idiot that told you that he'll
come get you, Mom?

02:07.100 --> 02:09.620
That was awfully rude of you to say, don't
you think?

02:09.830 --> 02:13.390
Oh, geez, who was it? It's vexing!

02:13.540 --> 02:16.400
If it's something about the past, why don't
you ask Bell or something?

02:16.710 --> 02:19.040
No way! If I asked Bell...

02:19.110 --> 02:20.710
Oh, Ojou-sama!

02:20.710 --> 02:22.210
You're having dreams of the past?

02:22.210 --> 02:24.510
That's proof that
you're longing for your old home!

02:24.510 --> 02:26.620
Let's hurry home, as soon as tomorrow!

02:26.620 --> 02:29.780
Hurry, hurry!

02:30.390 --> 02:32.680
She'd say something like that for sure.

02:34.890 --> 02:37.330
Hey, Guu, what have you been doing?

02:38.030 --> 02:41.220
Serving all the kids that
saw Guu for the first time today.

02:42.300 --> 02:43.290
Oh, I see.

02:44.370 --> 02:45.940
Who was it!?

02:45.940 --> 02:50.000
Was it a friend of mine? One of my older
brothers or sisters?

02:50.870 --> 02:52.210
To think that Mom had enough brains to
worry about something so petty as this...

02:52.210 --> 02:55.230
No, I don't remember.
Mm, what was it? Who was it?
To think that Mom had enough brains to
worry about something so petty as this...

02:56.850 --> 03:00.710
Well, since it's something that you've already
forgotten, I'm sure it's not important.

03:00.920 --> 03:02.110
That's true!

03:02.690 --> 03:05.250
I guess this is as far
as my mom's brain goes...

03:08.560 --> 03:09.750
Morning!

03:10.930 --> 03:13.160
Well, today's lesson...

03:13.230 --> 03:14.200
Siesta!

03:14.960 --> 03:16.090
Cut it out!

03:16.530 --> 03:18.730
Eh? I'm not really cutting anything...

03:19.000 --> 03:21.630
Then, I'll give you some homework.

03:22.540 --> 03:24.240
Write a report.

03:24.240 --> 03:27.140
You're free to pick the topic. No matter what
you pick, finish it by tomorrow.

03:27.380 --> 03:29.780
So, today's class is over now!

03:29.850 --> 03:31.070
Good night!

03:37.090 --> 03:38.640
A free-topic report...

03:38.960 --> 03:40.390
It can be about anything, right?

03:40.460 --> 03:42.820
I think I'll come up with
a new recipe for cooking pokute.

03:42.960 --> 03:46.620
I think I'll write a
book report or a short novel.

03:46.730 --> 03:48.460
I'm going to finish my
calculation problem sheets!

03:48.530 --> 03:51.330
I'm going to finish up the one-piece dress
that I've been working on!

03:51.630 --> 03:54.190
Geez, we're the ones that have to have a
good grip on ourselves...

03:57.510 --> 04:00.630
A free-topic report... What should I do?

04:00.840 --> 04:04.040
How about reporting
on the habitat of wild animals?

04:04.250 --> 04:06.910
Eh? What would I be researching?

04:07.280 --> 04:09.410
For example... the Stupid Couple.

04:12.220 --> 04:14.090
Where's the fun in that?

04:14.160 --> 04:16.280
In the first place,
the Stupid Couple are humans.

04:16.460 --> 04:20.560
Studying is not about
whether or not it's fun to do.

04:20.730 --> 04:22.460
Are times like this the only times you can
make reasonable arguments!?

04:23.300 --> 04:25.960
Oh, Haré and Guu! What's up?

04:26.070 --> 04:30.060
I bet you guys came here to be jealous of
how lovey-dovey we are!

04:34.140 --> 04:36.040
Go ahead, look at us some more!

04:36.110 --> 04:39.710
And spread the legend of our love to the
entire world!

04:39.850 --> 04:41.840
That is the burning world of love!

04:41.920 --> 04:45.090
Oh no, burning, burning, burning love!

04:45.090 --> 04:46.180
Between Addy... and Chet...

04:46.260 --> 04:48.690
The burning love, yeah!

04:49.390 --> 04:52.920
What is this welcome-to-my-world
atmosphere that they always make?

04:53.000 --> 04:54.690
The legend of love?

04:54.830 --> 04:57.160
Wait! Legend?

04:57.500 --> 05:02.160
Hey, that might be cool, gathering the
legends of this village.

05:02.240 --> 05:05.040
Even though one thing turned into another,
it's all thanks to Guu...

05:06.110 --> 05:07.910
Can I really make them burn?

05:08.110 --> 05:09.630
A Molotov Cocktail!?

05:09.710 --> 05:10.350
Ah! You've gotten taller!

05:10.350 --> 05:11.650
Now, let's go home, let's go home.
Ah! You've gotten taller!

05:11.650 --> 05:12.080
Now, let's go home, let's go home.
Oh no, you make my head spin!

05:12.080 --> 05:13.220
Oh no, you make my head spin!

05:13.220 --> 05:14.200
Spinning, spinning, spinning...

05:14.820 --> 05:16.790
A legend, was it?

05:17.050 --> 05:19.280
Yeah. But it's okay if you don't know any.

05:19.390 --> 05:20.790
Let's see...

05:20.890 --> 05:23.620
This is a story I heard from my friend.

05:23.790 --> 05:27.320
A woman had her ear pierced.

05:28.100 --> 05:30.730
One day, she was going to disinfect the ear,
and took her earring off...

05:30.870 --> 05:34.930
...and a thin string was
hanging from the pierced area.

05:35.100 --> 05:37.070
Thinking it was rubbish, she tugged on it.

05:37.170 --> 05:44.200
But the string kept getting longer and longer,
without end, until it suddenly snapped.

05:46.420 --> 05:50.250
Low and behold, that string was
her precious optic nerve!

05:50.350 --> 05:52.120
A-And what happened?

05:52.590 --> 05:54.680
Well, it was her optic nerve...

05:54.760 --> 05:58.160
That means, her eye...

05:58.260 --> 06:00.350
A string from the ear...

06:02.830 --> 06:05.800
Oh, see you later, Bell.
You were a big help! Thanks!

06:08.140 --> 06:11.110
What's the point of feeling
jealous of a legend?

06:11.170 --> 06:12.160
Burn! Burn!

06:12.440 --> 06:14.240
That's enough! Hurry up and put it away!

06:15.580 --> 06:16.480
Oh!

06:17.280 --> 06:19.440
You guys always get along so well...

06:19.550 --> 06:21.640
Oh, Ashio! That's right!

06:21.780 --> 06:22.550
Hm?

06:23.290 --> 06:25.550
Oh, a legend...

06:25.790 --> 06:30.050
Come to think of it, one of my friends
went to the beach to play.

06:32.030 --> 06:34.960
And, he tripped and scraped his knee.

06:36.030 --> 06:40.970
His wound healed soon, but after a while he
started feeling strange things in his knee.

06:41.570 --> 06:46.060
It started hurting more and more,
and when he couldn't take it anymore
and went to the doctor...

06:46.710 --> 06:48.840
...he ended up having surgery immediately.

06:49.610 --> 06:54.610
When they opened his kneecap,
behind his kneecap...

06:54.680 --> 06:57.650
...was a bunch of small barnacles.

06:58.520 --> 07:00.490
Let's see, the other urban legends
that I know of...

07:00.490 --> 07:03.290
N-No need for any more legends of that sort.

07:03.790 --> 07:06.600
Well, thanks for letting me listen to it! See ya!

07:06.600 --> 07:09.620
Wait a minute! I still have a great one!

07:10.000 --> 07:10.930
Hey!

07:12.300 --> 07:15.200
What I want to hear
aren't those sort of legends!

07:15.270 --> 07:18.670
I mean what part of those stories are any
different from horror stories!?

07:20.110 --> 07:21.770
Oh, it's the elder!

07:26.850 --> 07:27.940
That's right...

07:28.020 --> 07:30.920
The elder would know this village's legends!

07:31.150 --> 07:32.090
Elder!

07:35.320 --> 07:36.950
Oh, Haré! And...

07:37.360 --> 07:38.620
Guu-sama!

07:38.960 --> 07:41.120
Hello, Elder...

07:41.200 --> 07:43.630
Haré and Guu-sama, why, yes, hello!

07:43.830 --> 07:47.860
Man, Elder's fear of Guu
is worse than usual today.

07:48.240 --> 07:51.430
Even though I want to
hear legends from him, I don't think he's
gonna tell me anything...

07:52.310 --> 07:56.510
I can't speak with you when you're
so far away. Come a bit closer!

07:56.610 --> 07:57.510
Yes!

07:59.820 --> 08:01.370
A bit closer...

08:02.450 --> 08:03.650
...a bit more...

08:04.290 --> 08:07.220
...a bit more!

08:07.420 --> 08:09.580
Did you call for me, Guu-sama?

08:10.390 --> 08:16.060
Tell this ignorant boy all the legends and
stories surrounding this village.

08:16.130 --> 08:18.900
Yes, as you wish.

08:19.670 --> 08:22.100
There really are legends in this village?

08:22.300 --> 08:28.070
Yes, in fact, this jungle
has a legend about a sacred beast.

08:28.140 --> 08:29.200
A sacred beast?

08:30.580 --> 08:31.740
It's called...

08:32.780 --> 08:34.370
The Pokute Legend!

08:35.680 --> 08:36.780
Pokute...

08:37.290 --> 08:40.820
Once a long time ago, pokutes were
worshipped as gods in this jungle...

08:40.820 --> 08:41.620
That's enough.

08:41.790 --> 08:46.630
However, one day, a woman and her infant
child got lost in the jungle.

08:46.700 --> 08:48.130
Listen to what others say!

08:49.400 --> 08:54.200
She apparently failed an attempt to cross the
river, so she was found downstream.

08:54.640 --> 08:57.470
However, the infant was
nowhere to be found.

08:58.940 --> 09:05.680
A year later, someone from the village
found a two-and-a-half-year old
child in a pokute nest.

09:07.480 --> 09:08.510
It couldn't be...

09:10.950 --> 09:13.890
That's right!
The pokutes were raising the child!

09:14.190 --> 09:18.060
Since then, the pokutes have been respected
as kind-hearted creatures...

09:18.060 --> 09:21.190
...and they've been a valuable food supply
for the village.

09:21.600 --> 09:25.260
There's some relationship between that story
and being a food source?

09:25.500 --> 09:27.900
Hey, what happened to that rescued baby?

09:28.170 --> 09:30.900
Yes, she still lives in this village.

09:30.970 --> 09:33.740
Eh? Then she must be really old!

09:34.140 --> 09:38.050
What are you talking about, Haré? She lives
right next door to you...

09:38.180 --> 09:38.740
Eh?

09:38.850 --> 09:40.080
It's Rebecca.

09:40.720 --> 09:43.240
I think it happened about 20 years ago.

09:43.690 --> 09:47.650
I see... Then, your story is more like a
memory than a legend.

09:47.960 --> 09:49.220
You could say that.

09:49.560 --> 09:50.890
I've had enough.

09:51.460 --> 09:52.650
Thanks, Elder.

09:52.930 --> 09:54.590
That's not what you really think.

09:55.530 --> 09:58.970
Why did you try to
cause a commotion like that?

09:59.030 --> 09:59.630
Hm?

09:59.700 --> 10:04.660
If relationships can go smoothly
because of a word of thanks, you can't
wish for better than that!

10:04.740 --> 10:06.000
That's fooling people.

10:06.110 --> 10:07.840
I call it moving up in the world.

10:08.980 --> 10:10.910
A child who hasn't come of age yet...

10:10.980 --> 10:12.170
How pitiful.

10:12.410 --> 10:14.310
Don't stare at me with eyes full of pity!

10:14.850 --> 10:15.940
Oh, that's right.

10:16.020 --> 10:17.320
I'm going to stop by Rebecca's house, okay?

10:19.360 --> 10:20.580
Rebecca?

10:21.060 --> 10:23.520
Oh? Isn't she home?

10:24.490 --> 10:28.660
I wanted to ask her if
she really was raised by pokutes...

10:29.630 --> 10:30.360
Eh?

10:31.970 --> 10:32.990
Pokute!?

10:41.840 --> 10:43.740
W-What's going on here!?

10:43.810 --> 10:45.340
This place is full of pokutes!

10:47.350 --> 10:50.720
Our ojou-sama is not currently here.

10:50.820 --> 10:53.220
I would like you to come back another day.

10:53.520 --> 10:54.680
Oh, I see.

10:54.890 --> 10:57.120
Yes, so please go home.

10:57.330 --> 10:59.620
I guess I have no choice...

11:01.030 --> 11:03.290
And who the hell is that taking a nap right
there, dammit!?

11:03.370 --> 11:05.530
I'm telling you that
our ojou-sama has stepped out!

11:05.530 --> 11:07.800
To where!?
If you're saying that she stepped out, why
don't you try telling me where she went!

11:07.800 --> 11:10.540
There's no way I'd give out such private
information to a complete stranger!

11:10.540 --> 11:12.270
And you're nothing but a mere servant!!

11:12.270 --> 11:13.910
Just because you're her previous primary
physician, don't raise your voice!

11:13.910 --> 11:15.680
You're the one with the loud mouth,
you human obstacle!

11:15.680 --> 11:16.750
What was that!?

11:16.750 --> 11:18.240
Sheesh, what's going on here?

11:18.610 --> 11:21.050
One of your friends is here, Ojou-sama.

11:21.150 --> 11:21.950
Hey.

11:22.120 --> 11:25.420
Oh, it's unusual for you to invite me to a
council meeting, doctor.

11:25.490 --> 11:26.220
You think so?

11:26.320 --> 11:31.430
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama,
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama...

11:31.430 --> 11:33.660
Senpai, people can hear you.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.830
Why are there pokutes here?

11:41.900 --> 11:43.500
What in the world are they doing?

11:47.780 --> 11:49.240
Cleaning the room?

11:54.620 --> 11:57.310
But...
Why are pokutes doing household chores?

11:58.090 --> 12:03.550
Huh! Can this really mean that she's raising
pokutes because she was raised by them?

12:03.660 --> 12:04.960
Is she a real pokute master?

12:06.260 --> 12:08.750
Huh? I didn't notice that they all
disappeared!

12:09.870 --> 12:11.860
Oh, welcome, Haré.

12:11.930 --> 12:14.030
H-Hello.

12:14.100 --> 12:16.840
Huh? My room is all clean again...

12:16.840 --> 12:17.810
How strange.

12:17.870 --> 12:18.900
Again?

12:19.480 --> 12:21.100
You haven't realized it?

12:21.940 --> 12:25.240
Then, the pokutes are doing things around
the house of their own will...

12:25.310 --> 12:29.750
In other words, it's the pokutes' parental
instinct toward Rebecca?

12:30.220 --> 12:32.020
And, what do you want today?

12:32.090 --> 12:33.420
Um... Well, let's see...

12:34.090 --> 12:35.080
A legend?

12:35.420 --> 12:38.590
Yeah, a legend about this village.
Anything will do.

12:39.060 --> 12:40.460
Let's see...

12:41.260 --> 12:43.730
I've heard of a story like this.

12:44.500 --> 12:48.300
You take two mirrors,
and place them face-to-face.

12:53.280 --> 12:56.210
And, when midnight strikes...

12:57.810 --> 13:00.340
...pokutes appear
from the depths of the mirror.

13:00.750 --> 13:06.090
If you're able to catch the pokute
in the one moment that it tries to jump
from one mirror to the other...

13:06.520 --> 13:10.150
...it will grant you any one wish.

13:11.060 --> 13:14.520
That's the legend I know. I never tried it out,
so I don't know if it's true or not.

13:14.860 --> 13:16.160
Hmm.

13:16.400 --> 13:19.060
Well, we have a town council
meeting now, so I'll be going.

13:19.130 --> 13:20.070
Oh, okay.

13:20.300 --> 13:21.670
Can I ask you to lock up the house?

13:21.740 --> 13:23.330
Sure. Take care.

13:23.410 --> 13:24.200
See ya.

13:29.210 --> 13:30.580
They're already starting to clean...

13:30.880 --> 13:32.780
Pokutes sure have it rough.

13:34.950 --> 13:36.990
Hey, what are you doing in someone else's
house!?

13:36.990 --> 13:39.480
Even though those are pokutes,
those are Rebecca's parents!

13:39.620 --> 13:41.380
Come on, spit them all out!

13:43.660 --> 13:45.520
Hey, Haré! How've you been doing?

13:45.590 --> 13:47.290
Oh yeah, that's right!

13:47.360 --> 13:49.090
You know, the other day,
Haré, you visited us, right?

13:49.160 --> 13:50.390
Put him back in!

13:50.470 --> 13:52.560
Come on, let me talk for at least a little bit!

13:52.630 --> 13:55.760
What? You're talking to Haré again?
Let me talk to him, Seiichi-kun.

13:56.040 --> 13:57.230
Hi!

13:57.470 --> 13:59.540
Yamada-san wants some yarn.

13:59.540 --> 14:01.080
She wants to knit a sweater.

14:01.080 --> 14:02.240
Right, Yamada-san?

14:04.650 --> 14:09.380
A sweater needs to be knit with each stitch
full of tears, emotions, and grudges.

14:10.390 --> 14:11.910
Oof!

14:12.090 --> 14:14.610
Wow, it's been quite a while
since we last came outside.

14:14.720 --> 14:16.320
Yeah, it brings back memories!

14:16.390 --> 14:19.290
Since we got out,
we may as well look around for a bit.

14:19.390 --> 14:20.030
Sounds good!

14:20.030 --> 14:21.690
No! Get back inside her!

14:21.760 --> 14:22.860
And here we go!

14:22.930 --> 14:23.490
Oh!

14:23.570 --> 14:24.460
A new rendezvous!

14:25.000 --> 14:26.900
Guu, put them back.

14:27.400 --> 14:28.370
Okay.

14:29.870 --> 14:31.900
Wait, don't put me back in as well!

14:31.970 --> 14:33.460
If you live here, it's like a palace.

14:33.610 --> 14:35.410
No! I want to go back!

14:36.280 --> 14:38.370
Oh no, doctor!

14:40.450 --> 14:42.750
Doctor? Aren't we going
to the council meeting?

14:42.820 --> 14:43.980
It's not that way.

14:44.150 --> 14:45.520
This way is the right way.

14:48.060 --> 14:50.390
I mean, the council meeting is just an
excuse.

14:50.790 --> 14:51.420
Eh?

14:52.130 --> 14:54.560
Weda-chan, I just wanted
to go somewhere alone with you.

15:00.200 --> 15:04.470
Oh my gosh, doctor,
you tell jokes with such a straight face!

15:04.540 --> 15:05.540
I didn't mean it as a joke...

15:05.540 --> 15:06.110
Let's head straight to the meeting without
taking any detours.
I didn't mean it as a joke...

15:06.110 --> 15:07.770
Let's head straight to the meeting without
taking any detours.

15:08.840 --> 15:09.610
Weda-chan...

15:09.880 --> 15:10.780
What?

15:11.710 --> 15:13.010
Could it be...

15:14.180 --> 15:16.080
...that you... hate me?

15:16.180 --> 15:17.120
Not really.

15:19.660 --> 15:21.120
What do you mean by, "Not really?"

15:21.620 --> 15:22.820
I'm home.

15:23.430 --> 15:24.090
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama...

15:24.090 --> 15:25.330
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama...
What's she doing?

15:25.330 --> 15:29.700
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama...
She's been like that since
Ojou-san went out with Dr. Clive.

15:29.700 --> 15:31.330
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama...
Mom and the school doc?

15:31.330 --> 15:31.600
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama...

15:31.600 --> 15:35.400
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama...
Senpai, Ojou-san can see
anyone she wants, don't you think?

15:35.470 --> 15:36.130
Shut up!

15:36.200 --> 15:41.070
The man best suited for
our ojou-sama is taller, more handsome,
and must be a refined gentleman!

15:41.240 --> 15:43.710
Don't force your third-party opinion on her.

15:43.780 --> 15:47.940
Such a sketchy, ordinary guy
is no good, no good at all!

15:48.020 --> 15:50.080
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama...

15:50.150 --> 15:52.620
Ojou-san's feelings are the most important.

15:52.960 --> 15:53.890
Right, Bocchan?

15:54.120 --> 15:55.650
Y-Yeah, that's true.

15:55.860 --> 16:00.230
Besides, I think it's impossible for Mom to
fall in love with that school doc.

16:00.660 --> 16:03.630
Then, Senpai, I'll head out
to go pick up Ojou-san soon.

16:04.000 --> 16:08.990
Come to think of it, I never asked Mom how
she felt about the school doc.

16:11.410 --> 16:14.240
Then, you ditched the doctor and came all
the way out here?

16:14.310 --> 16:16.140
Of course I did.

16:16.210 --> 16:17.540
I feel sorry for him.

16:17.610 --> 16:19.740
It would be good for him to show up here.

16:20.920 --> 16:22.680
What? The school doc isn't here yet?

16:22.750 --> 16:23.810
Thank heavens.

16:23.920 --> 16:26.720
But still, Mom sure is drunk already.

16:26.890 --> 16:29.060
Then, I will sober her up.

16:29.060 --> 16:32.580
Stop it. Why do you always think of only the
most basic and dangerous ideas?

16:32.860 --> 16:35.490
Well, whatever. But Weda,
don't you need to go home soon?

16:36.370 --> 16:37.760
It's fine. It's fine.

16:37.830 --> 16:39.390
Someone is waiting for you.

16:39.470 --> 16:40.700
It's fine. It's fine.

16:40.770 --> 16:41.740
Is it okay for you to ignore him?

16:41.800 --> 16:43.210
It's fine. It's fine.

16:43.210 --> 16:47.900
I mean, Ashio comes to
drag me back home so early,
but he's weak against puzzle games!

16:48.680 --> 16:50.870
I really don't understand
what you're talking about, Weda.

16:50.950 --> 16:52.610
Ashio sure has it tough.

16:53.220 --> 16:55.810
Come on, Ojou-san,
it's almost time to go home.

16:56.150 --> 16:57.150
Nooo!

16:57.150 --> 16:58.710
You've already had
too much to drink tonight.

16:58.850 --> 17:01.480
Ashio, the way you always
scold me hasn't changed a bit!

17:01.560 --> 17:03.050
It's really annoying!

17:03.560 --> 17:04.580
Is that so?

17:05.160 --> 17:08.650
But you know, there was a
time when I had a crush on Ashio.

17:08.760 --> 17:11.630
Oh, Weda, so you did have a girlish period?

17:11.630 --> 17:12.500
I'm sorry I did.

17:12.630 --> 17:14.800
I still think fondly of you.

17:16.410 --> 17:17.410
I see...

17:17.410 --> 17:19.500
All right, you guys have
something for each other!

17:19.570 --> 17:21.780
How you say "still" brings tears to my eyes...

17:21.780 --> 17:23.680
Maybe you still feel
something as well, Weda?

17:24.010 --> 17:24.940
Well...

17:27.050 --> 17:28.570
I do like him...

17:29.280 --> 17:32.850
But I-It's not really a-anything like that

17:34.290 --> 17:36.450
No, It's nothing like that...

17:37.130 --> 17:38.390
Congratulations!

17:38.390 --> 17:39.090
Congratulations!
It's the start of a new relationship!

17:39.090 --> 17:39.820
It's the start of a new relationship!

17:39.900 --> 17:42.690
What are you talking about!? That's the most
aggravating conclusion you can make!

17:42.760 --> 17:44.030
Yeah, yeah.
Now then, we're going to hurry on home.

17:44.030 --> 17:45.430
What are you doing!? Let me go!
Yeah, yeah.
Now then, we're going to hurry on home.

17:45.500 --> 17:46.470
Kya! So forceful!

17:46.470 --> 17:47.400
Go straight home!

17:47.470 --> 17:50.200
No! I have to clear up this
misunderstanding!!

17:50.410 --> 17:51.700
Good luck you two!

17:51.770 --> 17:52.640
Geez, Rebecca, stop that!

17:52.640 --> 17:53.900
Come on now...
Geez, Rebecca, stop that!

17:53.980 --> 17:56.210
Staying up late at night is
the enemy of beauty and health.

17:56.480 --> 17:58.310
Noo!

18:03.590 --> 18:04.880
Rebecca...

18:05.150 --> 18:07.310
Maybe she's a little jealous?

18:07.590 --> 18:10.650
All right, peeper No.2,
don't lose sight of them!

18:10.730 --> 18:11.690
Oh, right.

18:13.830 --> 18:15.350
Wait, who's a peeper!?

18:17.570 --> 18:21.430
Sheesh, everyone still has the wrong idea
cause they're drunk.

18:21.540 --> 18:25.130
And Ashio, you too... Don't say things like that
all of a sudden!

18:25.210 --> 18:26.500
It's shocking.

18:26.840 --> 18:28.940
Then, I'll just say it bit by bit.

18:29.340 --> 18:30.440
Bit by bit?

18:30.510 --> 18:33.970
And, if the ojou-san doesn't like it, I won't say
anything more.

18:34.450 --> 18:38.680
Misunderstandings can be cleared up in the
morning.

18:40.460 --> 18:43.190
That's true... Oh, well.

18:44.430 --> 18:47.590
It's too much of a bother, anyway. Besides...

18:48.000 --> 18:49.730
...it's not something that
disturbs me too much.

18:52.270 --> 18:55.700
But you know, Ashio,
you try to take care of me way too much.

18:55.770 --> 18:58.000
You don't have to come pick me up each and
every time.

18:58.340 --> 19:00.440
Of course I'll come pick you up...

19:00.440 --> 19:01.970
...no matter where you are.

19:06.380 --> 19:07.870
I'll come pick you up...

19:09.180 --> 19:10.280
...wherever you are...

19:11.820 --> 19:13.580
However many years it may take...

19:15.960 --> 19:17.620
So, Ojou-san...

19:18.290 --> 19:19.730
...wait for me.

19:22.730 --> 19:23.890
Please, wait for me...

19:26.370 --> 19:29.030
That's it... it was Ashio.

19:30.410 --> 19:33.100
Thanks, Ashio.

19:37.050 --> 19:39.310
So, why don't we go back home for once?

19:39.310 --> 19:39.940
No!

19:41.550 --> 19:44.880
The madam's worried,
so don't be so selfish like that...

19:45.050 --> 19:47.120
I'm not being selfish! Not at all!

19:47.120 --> 19:47.460
Don't thrash about so much.
I'm not being selfish! Not at all!

19:47.460 --> 19:49.120
Not at all, not at all, not at all...
Don't thrash about so much.

19:49.120 --> 19:49.390
Not at all, not at all, not at all...

19:49.390 --> 19:51.920
Not at all, not at all, not at all...
I-it's dangerous, Ojou-san.

19:51.990 --> 19:57.830
You know, Mom and Ashio
are more like family - like sister and brother -
more than lovers.

19:58.230 --> 20:01.790
And the child who's relieved
to say that isn't normal, either.

20:01.870 --> 20:02.930
Are you okay, Haré?

20:03.000 --> 20:06.910
I just want Mom to be happy,
as an important family member!

20:08.810 --> 20:10.400
Can I say something?

20:11.080 --> 20:11.880
What?

20:12.380 --> 20:13.870
You have an Oedipus complex.

20:14.650 --> 20:17.350
Who has an Oedipus complex!?

20:30.000 --> 20:31.990
The pokute legend...

20:33.500 --> 20:34.840
Oh no!

20:34.840 --> 20:37.740
I forgot about my homework!

20:38.440 --> 20:40.470
See, look at this! My new one-piece dress!

20:40.610 --> 20:42.370
Can someone try this new flavor?

20:42.440 --> 20:44.510
I wrote a romance novel!

20:44.510 --> 20:46.450
I drew a gangster manga!

20:46.620 --> 20:47.780
What should I do?

20:47.780 --> 20:49.980
Am I the only one that
forgot to do the homework?

20:50.520 --> 20:53.510
That's right, Guu forgot as well,
so I have some excuse.

20:53.590 --> 20:56.180
Hey, what did you do for homework, Guu?

20:56.860 --> 20:58.950
Amazing! It's a ship-in-a-bottle!

20:59.090 --> 21:00.330
That's an old man's hobby!

21:00.330 --> 21:02.820
Or rather, when did you
have time to build that!?

21:02.900 --> 21:05.260
Am I the only one that
forgot to do the homework!?

21:05.700 --> 21:06.600
Morning!

21:06.670 --> 21:08.600
Good morning!

21:09.400 --> 21:10.300
Now...

21:12.210 --> 21:14.200
First period today...

21:14.340 --> 21:15.280
Sir!

21:15.280 --> 21:16.510
Don't you have something to do before that?

21:16.510 --> 21:17.350
Our homework!

21:17.350 --> 21:18.610
The free-topic report!

21:19.650 --> 21:20.880
What was that about?

22:36.180 --> 22:37.520
NEXT EPISODE

22:37.520 --> 22:39.220
Eh? I'm going to do this?

22:39.220 --> 22:39.920
NEXT EPISODE

22:39.920 --> 22:43.120
It's not my style to do
something like this... Oh, well.

22:43.120 --> 22:43.920
NEXT EPISODE

22:43.920 --> 22:46.290
Let's see, it seems like girls
named Marie and Guu are really eager to
support the relationship between me and Weda...

22:46.290 --> 22:50.020
Let's see, it seems like girls
named Marie and Guu are really eager to
support the relationship between me and Weda...

22:50.800 --> 22:53.230
Honestly, it's like,
"Leave us alone," you know?

22:53.630 --> 22:54.230
That's it.

22:54.230 --> 22:56.430
Hey, damn you! Is that all you have to say!?
Can't you do it a little more seriously!?

22:56.500 --> 22:58.570
It was really dumb
of me to let you do all of it.

22:58.570 --> 23:00.440
Come to think of it,
Marie isn't her usual cheerful self lately...

23:00.440 --> 23:00.740
I wonder if something is wrong with her?

23:00.740 --> 23:01.410
I wonder if something is wrong with her?

23:01.410 --> 23:01.810
Sleeping Side-by-Side

23:01.810 --> 23:05.280
Next episode of Haré+Guu: Sleeping Side-by-Side
